    <briefdescription>
<para>This class is used in a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_managed_static" kindref="compound">ManagedStatic</ref> so that it is created on demand (when the first statistic is bumped) and destroyed only when llvm_shutdown is called. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>We print statistics from the destructor. This class is also used to look up statistic values from applications that use LLVM. </para>
